// model_info.jsonc - model catalog for nimroute. generated 2026-10-05, do not hand-edit.
// sources per entry in "source".
//   ctx/maxout + capabilities feed /v1/models; nudge_no_tools gates the spark reprompt
//   (models.nudge in config.yml overrides it).
//   reasoning_effort_levels lists the accepted reasoning_effort values, in order;
//   reasoning_toggle/budget mark on-off and token-budget control instead.
//   supported_parameters is the openrouter request-parameter list; [] = no record.
//   freepi_* is the free-pi served contract (its own proxy layer, not the
//   underlying model), from the official free-pi-cli provider config.
